{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Number of loading lists","Quantity specifying the number of loading lists, manifests or similar documents.","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Authentication identifier","Identification of the authentication.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Actual authentication location identifier","Identification of the location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","Transport means crossing the border identifier","Identification of the means of transport used in crossing the border.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of means of transport crossing the border code","Code specifying type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods in crossing the border.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","Characteristic","Details related to the characteristic.","Characteristic type code","Code specifying  the subject of the characteristic.","Characteristic value code","Code specifying the form of a characteristic value.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7111 / User code list","Defects","Details related to the defects noted.","Defects description","Description of the defects noted.","Rectification of defects description","Description of the rectification of defects.","ResponsibleGovernmentAgency","Details related to the responsible government agency.","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Manufacturer","Details related to the party which manufactures goods.","Manufacturer name","Name of the party that manufactures goods.","Manufacturer identifier","Identification of a party which manufactures goods.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","TransportMeansOperator","Details related to the operator of a means of transport (e.g. the captain of a vessel).","Transport means operator name","Name of the registered operator of the means of transport.","Transport means operator identifier","Identification of the registered operator of the means of transport.","TransportMeansOwner","Details related to the owner of means of transport.","Transport means owner name","Name of the registered owner of the means of transport.","Transport means owner identifier","Identification of the registered owner of means the of transport.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","ProductName","Details related to the name of a product.","Commodity name","Name or term that identifies the goods assigned by a seller as distinct from those of other sellers, in legal terms known as trademark, which helps to identify one item, a family of items, or all items of that seller.","Commodity name qualifier code","Code specifying the commodity name (e.g. common name, registered name, brand name).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7081","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him."],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"expiration","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ExpirationDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D051","u":"0001L","q":"4","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/expirationDateTime","ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","etir-carv"],"src":"BIP LPCO:7"},{"s":"identification","n":4,"d":5,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ID","f":"an..70","r":6,"w":"D014","u":"0001L","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/identificationIdentifier","ub":["cites","codex","e-phyt